{"type":"text","timestamp":1794308064515,"sessionID":"ses_e3b0b810dffegBA4eZqYEno8s9","part":{"id":"prt_1c51844e0001gaui4sl2OD7JFd","messageID":"msg_1c517ea5b0013bUooyw3ZAOVLQ","sessionID":"ses_e3b0b810dffegBA4eZqYEno8s9","type":"text","text":"## Objective\n- Build a book library app: Flask JSON API under `/api` (auth, books CRUD, reviews) plus a React/TypeScript Vite frontend styled with Tailwind, served by the backend from `frontend/dist`, data in SQLite under `./data`, listening on port 8000.\n\n## Important Details\n- Stack: Flask 3.1.3 + gunicorn 26.2.0 (`backend/requirements.txt`/`requirements.lock` unchanged — stdlib sqlite3/hashlib only); React 19.3.1 + Vite 8.3.5; Tailwind CSS v4.3.5 via `@tailwindcss/vite` (installed); Python 3.13.5, Node v24.22.1.\n- DB path: `BASE_DIR / \"data\"` where `BASE_DIR = Path(__file__).resolve().parent.parent` (= `/app/data` in Docker, `/workspace/data` locally).\n- Auth: `Authorization: Bearer <token>`; tokens stored in `tokens` table; passwords via `hashlib.pbkdf2_hmac` (120k iters, `salt$hexdigest`); username uniqueness case-sensitive; duplicate register → 409, bad login → 401.\n- API status decisions: register 201, login 200, POST books/reviews 201, PUT 200, DELETE 204, auth failures 401, unknown book 404, invalid pagination/field errors 400 with body `{\"error\": msg, \"errors\": {field: msg}}`.\n- Validation messages: \"Title is required\", \"Author is required\", \"Year must be an integer\", \"ISBN must be a string\", \"Rating must be an integer between 1 and 5\", \"Comment must be a string\", \"Username is required\", \"Password is required\", \"Username already taken\", \"Invalid username or password\", \"Authentication required\", \"Book not found\", \"You have already reviewed this book\", \"Request body must be a JSON object\".\n- `average_rating` = `round(AVG(rating), 1)` in Python (banker's rounding) or `null` when `review_count == 0`; `year`/`isbn` coerced: `None`/`\"\"` clears, digit-strings accepted for year.\n- Defaults: `page=1`, `page_size=10`; `q` case-insensitive LIKE over title/author/isbn (escaped); ordering `created_at DESC, id DESC`.\n- Frontend routing: custom path-based router (`parsePath`/`pushState`/`popstate`) — routes `/`, `/login`, `/register`, `/books/new`, `/books/{id}`, `/books/{id}/edit`; backend SPA fallback serves `index.html`, plus `/api/<path>` catch-all → 404 JSON.\n- Session in `localStorage` keys `token`/`username`; 401 clears session; register auto-logs-in; delete uses `window.confirm`.\n- `npm run build` now runs `tsc --noEmit && vite build` (tsconfig strict, added devDeps `typescript`, `@types/react`, `@types/react-dom`).\n- Local env: pip index is an internal mirror with `--break-system-packages`; flask installed system-wide; no docker/gunicorn binaries available locally (test via `app.test_client()` or `python`).\n\n## Work State\n### Completed\n- Read workspace: `Dockerfile`, `README.md`, `.dockerignore`, existing skeleton files; git tree was clean at commit `6ae330f base`.\n- Backend fully written to `/workspace/backend/app.py`: schema (users, tokens, books, reviews w/ `UNIQUE(book_id,user_id)` + FK cascade), all endpoints, `init_db()` at import, frontend catch-all serving `DIST`.\n- Backend smoke-tested via `app.test_client()`: health 200, register 201, duplicate 409, login 200+token, unauthed POST 401, create 201, list/search/pagination, PUT (isbn cleared when omitted), review 201, duplicate review 409, `average_rating` 5.0, `page=0` → 400, 404s, DELETE 204 → GET 404.\n- Frontend written: `vite.config.ts` (+tailwindcss plugin), `src/index.css` (`@import \"tailwindcss\";`), `src/api.ts` (types, `ApiError`, `apiFetch`, session helpers), `src/App.tsx` (router + header/auth), `src/pages/AuthPage.tsx`, `src/pages/BooksPage.tsx`, `src/pages/BookPage.tsx`, `src/pages/BookFormPage.tsx`, `src/main.tsx` (imports `./index.css`), `index.html` title → \"Book Library\".\n- Removed duplicate error block in `BookFormPage.tsx` and stray `getToken` import/export in `App.tsx`.\n- Tailwind + typescript deps installed; `package.json` scripts updated; `tsconfig.json` created.\n\n### Active\n- Verifying frontend compiles: typecheck and production build not yet run.\n\n### Blocked\n- (none)\n\n## Next Move\n1. Run `npx tsc --noEmit` and `npm run build` in `/workspace/frontend`; fix any type/JSX errors.\n2. Start backend locally (e.g. `cd /workspace && python3 -m flask --app backend/app:app run --port 8000` or gunicorn equivalent), verify `GET /api/health`, frontend HTML served at `/`, SPA fallback, and full API + UI flows (register → add book → review once → edit/delete → search/paging).\n\n## Relevant Files\n- `/workspace/backend/app.py`: full API implementation + static/SPA serving (entry `app:app`).\n- `/workspace/backend/requirements.txt`, `/workspace/backend/requirements.lock`: pinned deps, unchanged (no new Python deps).\n- `/workspace/Dockerfile`: builds `frontend/dist` via `npm ci && npm run build`, pip installs with lock, runs gunicorn on 8000, `mkdir -p data`.\n- `/workspace/frontend/package.json`: scripts (`build` = `tsc --noEmit && vite build`), deps incl. `tailwindcss`, `@tailwindcss/vite`, `typescript`.\n- `/workspace/frontend/vite.config.ts`: react + tailwindcss plugins, `/api` proxy to `http://localhost:8000`.\n- `/workspace/frontend/tsconfig.json`: strict typecheck config for `src`.\n- `/workspace/frontend/src/api.ts`: API client, `Book`/`Review`/`BookPage` types, `ApiError`, session storage.\n- `/workspace/frontend/src/App.tsx`: path router, header (signed-in username + Sign out / Sign in + Register), auth error handling.\n- `/workspace/frontend/src/pages/BooksPage.tsx`: book table, search, paging (PAGE_SIZE 10), Add book button.\n- `/workspace/frontend/src/pages/BookPage.tsx`: book details, reviews list, rating form (hidden if already reviewed), edit/delete with confirm.\n- `/workspace/frontend/src/pages/BookFormPage.tsx`: add/edit forms showing API validation messages.\n- `/workspace/frontend/src/pages/AuthPage.tsx`: sign-in/register forms; register auto-logs-in.\n- `/workspace/frontend/src/index.css`: Tailwind v4 entry (`@import \"tailwindcss\";`).\n- `/workspace/data/`: SQLite DB location (created at import; test DB from smoke tests exists).","time":{"start":1794308064480,"end":1794308064483}}}
