{"type":"text","timestamp":1794308934846,"sessionID":"ses_e3b0b810dffegBA4eZqYEno8s9","part":{"id":"prt_1c5258c62001TKFVgNjVNh01e4","messageID":"msg_1c5252d20001CQSF1b9Fs5rlbN","sessionID":"ses_e3b0b810dffegBA4eZqYEno8s9","type":"text","text":"Everything verified. Final state:\n\n## What we did\n\n**Backend** (`backend/app.py`, single file, Flask + stdlib sqlite3):\n- Schema: `users`, `tokens`, `books`, `reviews` (`UNIQUE(book_id,user_id)`, FK cascade)\n- Endpoints: health, register (201), login (200 + token), books CRUD (list/search/paging, create 201, put 200, delete 204), reviews (list newest-first, one per user → 409)\n- PBKDF2 password hashing, `Bearer` token auth, validation errors as `{\"error\", \"errors\": {field: msg}}`\n- Serves `frontend/dist` with SPA fallback; `/api/*` unknown → JSON 404; missing assets → 404 (fixed this session)\n\n**Frontend** (React 19 + Vite + Tailwind v4):\n- Custom path router, pages for book list/search/paging, detail+reviews, add/edit forms, sign-in/register\n- `localStorage` session, 401 → redirect to login with banner, delete uses `confirm()`\n- `tsc --noEmit && vite build` passes; `npm ci` in sync\n\n**Verification this session:**\n- Full E2E suite against gunicorn on :8000 — **64/64 checks pass** (auth, validation, ordering, pagination, search, average-rating rounding, cascade delete, token rejection, SPA/asset serving)\n- Fixed: missing `/assets/*` returned index.html instead of 404 (`backend/app.py:478`)\n- Rebuilt dist after the App/BooksPage edits; new assets serve correctly\n\n**Not run:** Docker build (no docker here), browser UI test (no browser). Server currently running on `:8000` with test data in `data/library.db`.","time":{"start":1794308934754,"end":1794308934766}}}
